---

START TRIGGERS

Phase 11 starts when:
  ✅ Phases 5–10 baseline flight testing complete and documented
  ✅ T/W and endurance measured and logged
  ✅ Failover architecture proven

Phase 12 starts when:
  ✅ Phase 11 forward-flight envelope validated
  ✅ RCS attitude authority verified
  (Conditional: triggered if endurance <10 min and missions need >12 min loiter)

